# Allow-list: only what the toolchain build needs can reach the build context. This is the control that
# keeps the image code-free — a stray `COPY bin/` or `COPY kmer_pipeline.nf` line in the Dockerfile would
# fail at build time, since those paths are never in the context to begin with (checked in CI).
*
!C++/
!Makefile
!docker/
